 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "What does a change to billing-api need before it can merge?\n[2025-07-03] standup/atlas/2025-07-03: Changes to the billing API need a rollback plan attached to the pull request. [2025-02-06] standup/atlas/2025-02-06: Billing-api calls the ledger service for invoice postings, so treat the ledger service as a hard dependency of billing-api. [2026-03-25] handover/2026-03-25-billing-api: The billing API has a new home: team Dune. Boreal kept it until today.",
